    "updated_at": "2022-05-02T12:50:43Z",
    "body": "> Not sure, but wouldn't it make sense to include this somehow as a default also to starship? Or is this outside of it's scope entirely?\n\nI think this would be outside the scope. We're a shell prompt, not a shell configuration framework. As a general rule, we try to keep any settings changes to the minimum required to make things run.\n\n",
